<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hansol Paper 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Hansol Paper 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     2,700 vs 2,850</p>
<p>    Net					     44.66 vs 40.25</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>     common shares		 stock	    3 vs none</p>
<p>					  cash	    9 vs 15</p>
<p>     preferred shares	     cash	   10 vs 16</p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,058.24 vs 887.75</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   55.25 vs  47.77</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     0.55 (gain) vs 4.38 (gain)</p>
<p>    Div Register					Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Payment				 before March 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Hansol Paper Co Ltd's share capital expanded to 17.81 million in 1996 from 15.01 million due to rights issues and conversion to stocks from bonds.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5649</p>
</text>
